  Lancelot examined the Library of Science and discovered the following 
properties:
  The Library of Science raises your Sage ability by one level.  For 
example, a skill level of 0 would rise to skill level 1.  The reader of this 
strangely compelling work becomes completely engrossed with it, and after 
this book is perused, it crumbles to dust and merges with the sands of time. 
Use the "Use Item" Action to invoke its powers.

Special Abilities:  
